    "preamble": "D.Muthupandi vs Mr.Jayarama Pandiyan on 29 April, 2024 Author: G.R.Swaminathan Bench: G.R.Swaminathan 1 Cont.P.(Md)No.816 Of Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated: 29.04.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice G.R.Swaminathan CONT.P.(MD)No.816 of 2024 In W.P.(MD)No.5805 of 2024 D.Muthupandi ... Petitioner Vs. 1. Mr.Jayarama Pandiyan, Designated Officer, Office of the Deputy Director of Health Services, Multipurpose Health Supervisors(F) Training School, Viswanathapuram, Madurai 14. 2. Mr.Rajkumar, Food Safety Officer, O/o.the Deputy Director of Health Services, Multipurpose Health Supervisors(F) Training School, Viswanathapuram, Madurai 14. ... Respondents Prayer: Contempt petition filed under Section 11 of th Contempt of Courts Act 1971, to punish the respondents for wilful disobeying of the order and having committed contempt over the orde dated 25.03.2024 in W.P.(MD)No.5805 of 2024 by this Court. For Petitioner : Mr.R.Ramasamy For Respondents : Mr.Veerakathiravan, Additional Advocate General, assisted by, Mr.G.Vairam Santhosh, Additional Government Pleader. * ** https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/3 2 CONT.P.(MD)NO.816 ORDER D.Muthupandi vs Mr.Jayarama Pandiyan on 29 April, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/176927077/ 1",
